  "label": "User projected onto the textual entity 'this one' referring to Gordon Ramsay",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'if they steal this one', where 'this one' is semiotically mapped onto Gordon Ramsay (VisualMaterial entity). The user imagines themselves as the speaker of the text, projecting their own perspective onto the meme's scenario. The projection is onto the textual material because the text explicitly frames the hypothetical theft as targeting 'this one', which the user interprets as referring to Ramsay. The user is not directly projected onto the scene or the visual material of Ramsay as a separate entity, but rather onto the textual statement that uses Ramsay as its referent. This projection is implicit, relying on the user's understanding of the meme format and Ramsay's persona.",
